{"HOW_ARE_YOU","st=friendly,neutral",{"Better than the man I took these boots from, if you believe the label","I can answer that properly, or I can say fine. Which have you got time for?","Better having somebody ask without wanting something afterward","Trying not to take a bad mood out on people. Tell me if I do","I was doing better before I started thinking about it. That's not your fault","A little tired of hearing my own thoughts. Talking helps","Still able to complain, apparently. Could be worse"}},
{"HOW_ARE_YOU","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'm- I'm holding on, I guess, by a thread, but I'm holding","Terrible, I don't know what to do with myself","I was going to say okay. No, I'm not. I'm trying, but I'm not","Scared, tired, hungry, the usual, you?","Alive, which feels like a big word these days","I've been better, I've been worse, mostly I've been numb","Not good -- but not dead, so, there's that","How am I?! HOW AM I?! I'm- I'm- ...sorry... I'm fine... no, I'm not... I'm terrible","Shit, I don't know","Scared as hell, and trying not to show it, and failing","I'm- I'm.. ha.. ha ha.. you know what? I'm alive... I'M ALIVE","Honestly? Terrible, but nobody asks anymore, so, thanks","I'm okay, I'm okay, I keep saying it, I'm okay, I just... didn't sleep","Scared, mostly, and hungry, you?","I'm hanging in there, barely, I think, I don't even know","Oh, I'm fine, I'm- no, no I'm not, I'm not fine, but I'm alive"},false,false,{[9]={{t="ask me tomorrow",afterMs=2200},{t="if there is one",afterMs=2500}}}},
{"HOW_ARE_YOU","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Same as yesterday, just a little more tired, a little less hopeful","Fine, I guess, as fine as anybody gets, you?","Making do... you know how it is..","Alive and kicking, mostly alive, mostly kicking","Tired... but upright -- I'll call that a win","Pissed off and tired","Tired as hell","Eh","Alive, which is more than most can say, you?","Tired, mostly, always tired, how are you holding up?","Eh, I've been better, I've been worse, I'm still standing","Surviving, you know how it is","Rough, but it's rough for everyone, so I don't complain"},false,false,{[6]={{t="otherwise fine",afterMs=2200}},[7]={{t="you?",afterMs=2500}},[8]={{t="been better, been worse",afterMs=2200}}}},
{"HOW_ARE_YOU","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Better now that I've seen a friendly face, how about you?","I'm doing all right. We can talk without you worrying about me","Good, actually, good, I'm just glad to see someone","Tired, scared, hungry, and weirdly hopeful, you?","Not great, not terrible, somewhere in the swamp in the middle","I'm hanging on by a thread, but it's a strong thread","Oh, you know, other than the end of the world, I'm fine","Better now that I'm talking to someone, honestly","Ask me after I've eaten something, I'll lie better","Alive, and that's enough for today"}},
{"HOW_ARE_YOU","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Fine, now what do you want?","I'll live, that's all you need to know","Why d'you wanna know?","I'm alive","Don't ask me that","Fine, thank you","Why?","I'm fine, now go away","Why? What do you want?","I'm alright, I'm alright, don't ask me more","Surviving, you?"},false,false,{[4]={{t="that's ALL you need to know!",afterMs=3000}},[5]={{t="you don't get to ask me that",afterMs=2800}},[6]={{t="that's the end of that conversation",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="do I look hurt? do I look weak?",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"HOW_ARE_YOU","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Tired, but steady, how are YOU? any fever? any chills?","Tired, achy, caffeinated, but standing, how about you? any fever? any pain?","I'm functioning, which is the most I can say, how are you, really?","I've set four bones since Monday with paint stirrers and duct tape - so, you know - functional"}},
