{"HOW_ARE_YOU","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"I'm- I'm okay, I'm okay, I'm- no, I'm not okay, I'm terrified, is that allowed?","I'm scared. I keep trying to settle down, but I can't stop shaking","Don't ask me, it makes me think about it, and thinking about it is worse"}},
