{"HOW_ARE_YOU","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"Better now that you're here, honestly, much better","Hanging in there, how about you?","Tired, but happy to see you, how about you?","Not bad, not bad at all, and you? you look well","Good, good, I'm good, thanks to people like you","Surviving, with a smile, how about you?","I've had better days, but this one just got better","Honestly? Scared, but happy you asked, you always ask","Fine, and glad of it, you?","I'm okay, because of you, because of folks like you","Taking it one hour at a time, and you?","Alive, thankful, a bit sore, and you?","Tired, hungry, still standing, you?","Doing alright -- I think, doing alright!","Not too bad, considering. You're the first to ask this week","Better than yesterday, worse than tomorrow, but good with company","Hanging in, and you? tell me, I want to know","Well, I'm still here, and so are you, that's something","Pretty good, actually, thanks to your help","Feeling lucky, to be honest, lucky to know you","It's a hard day, but a good one, now that I've seen you","I've been better, but your face always cheers me up!","So-so, and happy, and you?","Okay, I think, as okay as anyone can be","Tolerable, can't complain, you?","Oh, I'm doing fine, thanks, just fine","Weary, but not broken, and you?","I'm alright, my friend, I'm alright","Alive, tired, a little hungry, you?","Still smiling, mostly, thanks to you"}},
{"HOW_ARE_YOU","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"Fine, don't care to discuss it","Why do you ask? what's it to you?","I'm fine, and I'm not telling you more","Mind your own, I don't need a conversation","I'm surviving, no thanks to people like you","Terrible, since you showed up","Why? you planning to make it worse?","I'm fine, leave me be","I don't think you care","Not your concern","How am I? Wary, mostly","Don't ask me that -- don't pretend to care!","I was fine until you came along","Well enough, now BACK off","Alive, if that's what you're asking","Fine, as long as you stay over there","Why are you asking? what do you want?!","It's none of your concern, truly","I'm fine, thanks, and goodbye","I'd be better without you!!","I'm surviving, which is more than I can say for some","Doing alright, until now","I don't owe you a conversation","Just fine, no thanks to you","Don't act friendly, it doesn't suit you","Fine... Done... Next?","I'm well enough to say go away","Better when you're not around","Asking nicely won't help you","Let's not pretend we're friends"}},
{"HOW_ARE_YOU","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Terrified, how do you think? they're RIGHT THERE","Not great, not great at all, did you hear that? did you?","I'm- I'm shaking, they're close, okay? they're close","Ask me later, ask me when they're GONE!","I'm still scared. Is there somewhere we can get out of sight?","Barely holding on, barely, I can hear them","Fine- no- NOT fine, they're out there, and I'm not","Shh, I'll tell you, but later, please, later","I could be better -- I could be somewhere else!","My heart's trying to leave my chest... so -- you tell me"}},
