{"HOW_ARE_YOU","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"How am I? Oh, wonderful, I love being hunted, you should try it","Alive, which is a hell of a lot more than I can say for my friends","Same as everyone else, scared, hungry, and sick of looking over my shoulder","Peachy... can't you tell? I'm just fucking peachy","Tired, {g:man|lady}... tired in a way sleep doesn't fix"}},
